  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145376",
      "title": "Adding A First Page",
      "lectureOrder": 231,
      "videoOrder": 215,
      "sourceHash": "bcbe421b974d72a56e929c4da2fd9cb4e01239f40f894385efcdc66d4651a8b8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 4.29,
          "en": "So, now that we had a first glimpse",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 8.24,
          "en": "at this file-based routing system in theory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.24,
          "end": 10.21,
          "en": "let's apply it in practice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.21,
          "end": 12.55,
          "en": "to this demo project we set up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.55,
          "end": 15.32,
          "en": "so that we really understand it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.32,
          "end": 18.4,
          "en": "This pages folder is important as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.4,
          "end": 21.78,
          "en": "And in this pages folder, we can add a new file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.78,
          "end": 23.11,
          "en": "We can add a new file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.11,
          "end": 26.82,
          "en": "and we can, for example, name it, index.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.82,
          "end": 31,
          "en": "You'll learn that index.js is a special file name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31,
          "end": 36,
          "en": "such that Next.js will not use the file name as a path then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 40.39,
          "en": "but instead will load the index.js component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.39,
          "end": 45.21,
          "en": "as the main component for slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.21,
          "end": 48.24,
          "en": "So, here in this case, we have index.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 52.09,
          "en": "and this file would be loaded if we just visit our domain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.09,
          "end": 55.84,
          "en": "and then we have no other path after our domain.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.84,
          "end": 58.383,
          "en": "So, just our domain slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.3,
          "end": 62.863,
          "en": "But what goes into this index.js file?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.74,
          "end": 68.65,
          "en": "Well, as mentioned before, just a regular React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.65,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "There is nothing special to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 73.57,
          "en": "You don't need any special code in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.57,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "You just add our normal React component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 78.75,
          "en": "you export this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 83.17,
          "en": "and then, with that, Next.js will render that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.17,
          "end": 86.43,
          "en": "when a request reaches this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.43,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "through next.js routing system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 92.50999999999999,
          "en": "So therefore, in this file, we can add a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.50999999999999,
          "end": 94.85,
          "en": "and we can add a class-based component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.85,
          "end": 96.75999999999999,
          "en": "or a function-based component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.75999999999999,
          "end": 99.96000000000001,
          "en": "And I will stick to function-based components only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.96000000000001,
          "end": 101.62,
          "en": "in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.62,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "So therefore, we can add a new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "a new function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 109.2,
          "en": "and name this, HomePage, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 111.24000000000001,
          "en": "Now, the name is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.24000000000001,
          "end": 113.78999999999999,
          "en": "This doesn't have to be named HomePage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.78999999999999,
          "end": 115.78,
          "en": "any name is okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.78,
          "end": 118.3,
          "en": "I'm just using HomePage as a name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.3,
          "end": 121.12,
          "en": "because it will be the root page loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.12,
          "end": 124.35,
          "en": "And whilst it is a regular component, technically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.35,
          "end": 126.61,
          "en": "we will treat it as a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.61,
          "end": 128.75,
          "en": "It will occupy the entire page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.75,
          "end": 132.22,
          "en": "And that's why I add page in the component name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.22,
          "end": 135.283,
          "en": "But you can name this component however you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.57999999999998,
          "end": 139.28,
          "en": "Now, in this component, we then wanna return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.28,
          "end": 142.29,
          "en": "our JSX code just as we know it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 144.27,
          "en": "So, here I will return,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.27,
          "end": 146.84,
          "en": "let's say, a div and end that div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.84,
          "end": 151.12,
          "en": "a simple H1 tag where I say, The Home Page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.12,
          "end": 154.89,
          "en": "Definitely not too inspiring yet, but we'll get there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.89,
          "end": 159.71,
          "en": "Now we need to export this function as the file default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.71,
          "end": 161.6,
          "en": "So, either like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.6,
          "end": 164.06,
          "en": "or what I like to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.06,
          "end": 165.51,
          "en": "but it's up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.51,
          "end": 166.423,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.27,
          "end": 170.06,
          "en": "We need to export this function, this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.06,
          "end": 172.07,
          "en": "so that Next.js knows",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.07,
          "end": 174.7,
          "en": "which components should be rendered as a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.7,
          "end": 175.84,
          "en": "because in theory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 175.84,
          "end": 178.66,
          "en": "you could of course define multiple components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.66,
          "end": 181.233,
          "en": "and have multiple functions in that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.45,
          "end": 185.51,
          "en": "Now, with all of that, once you've saved that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.51,
          "end": 187.29,
          "en": "we can see it in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.29,
          "end": 189.3,
          "en": "For this, in your terminal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.3,
          "end": 191.72,
          "en": "simply run, npm run dev,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.72,
          "end": 193.93,
          "en": "to bring up the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.93,
          "end": 196.95,
          "en": "for this Next.js application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 201.34,
          "en": "It will open up on localhost 3000 by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 201.34,
          "end": 204.23,
          "en": "And therefore, once you visit that in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.23,
          "end": 205.84,
          "en": "you should see this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.84,
          "end": 207.47,
          "en": "And it's just a bit big here for me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 207.47,
          "end": 210.513,
          "en": "because I zoomed in quite a lot so that you can see this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.41,
          "end": 213.6,
          "en": "So, that's what you should see on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.6,
          "end": 215.84,
          "en": "And of course, that's the content returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 215.84,
          "end": 218.98,
          "en": "by this component in our index.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.98,
          "end": 220.51,
          "en": "And we do see this on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.51,
          "end": 224.92000000000002,
          "en": "because we're visiting our domain slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.92000000000002,
          "end": 226.76,
          "en": "There's nothing after that slash.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 226.76,
          "end": 229.61,
          "en": "If I would enter about here, it would crash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 229.61,
          "end": 232.64,
          "en": "and we would get this default 404 page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 232.64,
          "end": 234.32999999999998,
          "en": "which we get here during development,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 234.32999999999998,
          "end": 237.37,
          "en": "because we didn't define a component for that yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.37,
          "end": 239.77,
          "en": "Well, that's what we're going to do next though.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
